{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f3988ddd6abd6d5fc6f8ff6e64f69b3d87653e38ae628611cd1d4bd1d3985528", "ja": "（ふぅ……劇場でのイベントが、無事終了した。\nさて、打ち上げのお店はどこにしようかな……？）", "zh": "（呼……剧场的活动顺利结束了。好了，庆功宴的店要选在哪里呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "30fc1564e4e008a1cbd8b0f8758973f952feeedbf752688bab4bcfbf107189e0", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまで～す。\nなにか考えごと中ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦啦～\n是在想什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1002_p", "source_sha256": "895d0eb09156d024f98c3cefc87ef72d5ce5b192dc3420171278b16c1d97c1a2", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま。打ち上げをどこで\nやるか迷っててな……翼は、どこか希望あるか？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了。正在犹豫要在哪里\n办庆功宴……翼，你有什么想去的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "59c741301da6a2a801928238c7abc4587bb0d70d47c8b23830115be677cfe595", "ja": "わたしですか？　うーん……あっ！　はいはーい！\n劇場でやりたいでーす！", "zh": "是我吗？嗯——啊！我有个主意——！\n我想在剧场举办！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4593d740ac8bff54367f715d64001804fe3387ac82e0ab48ef23b068c0466538", "ja": "えっ、劇場でいいのか？　まあ、確かにそれなら、\n関係者全員を呼べるし、いいかもしれないな。", "zh": "诶，在剧场举行没问题吗？嗯，不过确实这样的话，就能把所有相关人员都叫来，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b14068d710952c9c1b5885a7bd4f8d89ba24798ebc385dffd3ed8cd183496646", "ja": "でしょ～？　きっと盛り上がりますよ～♪\n劇場のパーティーって、すっごく楽しいもん。", "zh": "对吧～？肯定会很热闹的～♪\n剧场的派对特别开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "093f6f712d8d680ee551bd77d41b61f795ab5853e6fffd769fa14adbe8926dd5", "ja": "あっ、そういえば{$P$}さん。\nこの前くれたプレゼント、ありがとうございました！", "zh": "啊，对了，{$P$}先生。谢谢您之前送我的礼物！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "dffdc3481fa10629af043803e345e9cf255b870681d17db7125065c09427bf6b", "ja": "わたし、出かけるときいつもかぶってますよ～。\nすっごく気に入っちゃった♪", "zh": "我出门的时候一直都戴着呢～\n超级喜欢的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8494c72f92e0adeccd37ee28d6d23358b305bd1a2338ef8769ca87c8c134c6c9", "ja": "うん？　ああ、あの帽子か。\n喜んでくれたなら、こっちも嬉しいよ。", "zh": "嗯？啊，是那顶帽子啊。\n你喜欢就好，我也很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "65223dc4316e12bf795e3b101cba562c9c52a3566534f46227517f79e3b414f3", "ja": "えへへ、それじゃあ……。\nプレゼントもうひとつくださ～い！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那么……请再给我一份礼物～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1010_p", "source_sha256": "20bed515bbcf95b1197792bd4f397b9625373d51546f603db4012f04183715b9", "ja": "えっ……なんでそんな……。", "zh": "诶……干吗这样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f2f1ca26f7e12e075ec9a4284360cc2212b9964c03d655f99d74eb6bfba4ecd6", "ja": "だって{$P$}さんは、\nわたしが喜ぶとうれしくなっちゃうんですよね～？", "zh": "因为{$P$}先生看到我开心，自己也会高兴起来，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "67d73ef650a3d9eb7a5b8d78b0faeba59ee9caee3cec82aa8e1491a4064140d3", "ja": "プレゼントをもらったら、わたしもうれしいし。\nこういうのって、ウィンウィンの関係でしょ？", "zh": "收到礼物的话，我也会很开心嘛。\n这种不就是双赢的关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1013_p", "source_sha256": "94ef315b8414595156b94b6dfb1ae50d4704ce9a3e5f84d60be0d4ddf343447c", "ja": "うーん、そうかな……。\n俺の財布が一方的に負けてる気がするけど。", "zh": "嗯——是这样吗……我怎么觉得是我的钱包单方面输了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e89422e84d4c2833cfc87b6320ed412d78318a8f0dbef4d53716e3111cbf1420", "ja": "そんなことないですってば。だってわたし、プレゼント\n貰ったら、次のお仕事も頑張れちゃうかもですよ～？", "zh": "才不是那样呢。因为我收到礼物的话，说不定连下次的工作也会更有干劲哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d601fdc66a2913c3160193870b4fe6fb902b5101677ee940c3dc3feebcc13521", "ja": "ね？　全然負けなんかじゃないでしょ？\nねえ{$P$}さん……ダメぇ？", "zh": "对吧？这完全算不上输，对不对？\n喂，{$P$}先生……不行嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1016_p", "source_sha256": "98b4fc275f5d306f655fa066e95fe89d6e99ba78f849555382ac4cf13be95ab4", "ja": "うーん……まあいいか。考えておくよ。\nそのかわり、本当に次も頑張ってくれるんだろうな？", "zh": "嗯……好吧。我会考虑一下的。\n不过，你下次真的也会努力的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0223_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0223_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e4d9cc4ae02492f4b81ca2e5e43516c891b034e02418d25238037d6724f11118", "ja": "やったー♪　わかってますよ～。次も、\nその次も！　頑張っちゃうから……お願いしますね～？", "zh": "太好了♪我知道的哦～下次，还有下下次！我都会努力的……拜托你啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
